ecaed.mp4?t=1773429797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1 No Attacks, Only Pure Evasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no fighting back, only your skills and instincts will keep you alive! The further you go, the <strong>tougher the enemies, the trickier the paths, and the faster your decisions must be</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/eb6ca740d3e97bf26082cc58106b9e6a.poster.avif?t=1773429797\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/eb6ca740d3e97bf26082cc58106b9e6a.webm?t=1773429797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/eb6ca740d3e97bf26082cc58106b9e6a.mp4?t=1773429797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Explore Unique Biomes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey will take you through <strong>multiple mysterious biomes</strong>, each with its own atmosphere and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/c7128b21159c98a37e23260b81945e51.poster.avif?t=1773429797\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/c7128b21159c98a37e23260b81945e51.webm?t=1773429797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/c7128b21159c98a37e23260b81945e51.mp4?t=1773429797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Face Powerful Bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome hides a powerful entity guarding the path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive, unpredictable, and deadly, these bosses will push your reflexes to their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/5972bcf6005e32c37cf04dbba368cbd8.poster.avif?t=1773429797\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/5972bcf6005e32c37cf04dbba368cbd8.webm?t=1773429797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/5972bcf6005e32c37cf04dbba368cbd8.mp4?t=1773429797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Climb the Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against players worldwide! Your ranking is based on <strong>survival time, world level, and XP collected</strong>. Can you go further than anyone else?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/4bd88669576092daef174d113ccac348.avif?t=1773429797\" width=600 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2e Uncover the Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is watching the simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress deeper, fragments of a hidden story begin to emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What lies beyond the final gate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608390/extras/d9785ec3853c0392b44ccec33c64e9b3.poster.avif?t=177